  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Code interview transcripts against a literature-grounded framework (with optional model drafts), review every code with an audit trail, measure inter-coder reliability on a blind double-coded sample, cross-tabulate and group codes into themes, and export Excel, Word and Gioia-style outputs. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
